
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#080b18">
<title>MS HOSTING | Free Cloud Hosting</title>

<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:#080b18;
  color:#fff;
}
header{
  padding:20px 7%;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;
  border-bottom:1px solid #202944;
}
.logo{font-size:25px;font-weight:900;color:#8b7cff}
nav a{
  color:#ddd;text-decoration:none;
  margin-left:18px;font-size:14px
}
.hero{
  min-height:530px;
  padding:100px 20px 70px;
  text-align:center;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top,#24205c,#080b18 70%);
}
.tag{
  display:inline-block;
  border:1px solid #6255db;
  color:#a99eff;
  padding:9px 18px;
  border-radius:30px;
  font-size:13px;
}
h1{
  font-size:clamp(38px,8vw,65px);
  margin:28px 0 18px;
}
h1 span{color:#8d7cff}
.hero p{
  color:#aab1ca;
  line-height:1.8;
  max-width:600px;
  margin:auto;
}
.btn{
  display:inline-block;
  margin:30px 7px 0;
  padding:14px 24px;
  background:#7565f5;
  border-radius:9px;
  color:white;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:bold;
}
.btn.secondary{
  background:transparent;
  border:1px solid #555b79;
}
section{padding:65px 7%}
.section-title{text-align:center;margin-bottom:35px}
.section-title h2{font-size:30px}
.section-title p{color:#9ba4bd;margin-top:12px}
.cards{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
  gap:20px;
}
.card{
  background:#11172a;
  border:1px solid #293451;
  padding:27px;
  border-radius:15px;
  transition:.2s;
}
.card:hover{
  transform:translateY(-5px);
  border-color:#8373ff;
}
.card .icon{font-size:35px}
.card h3{margin:18px 0 12px}
.card p{color:#aab1ca;line-height:1.7;font-size:14px}
.status{
  display:inline-block;
  margin-top:18px;
  color:#a99eff;
  font-size:12px;
}
.about{
  text-align:center;
  background:#101629;
  border-top:1px solid #28314b;
  border-bottom:1px solid #28314b;
}
.about p{
  color:#aab1ca;
  line-height:1.8;
  max-width:650px;
  margin:18px auto;
}
footer{
  text-align:center;
  padding:30px;
  color:#8e98b3;
  font-size:13px;
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  header{padding:17px 5%}
  nav a{margin-left:9px;font-size:12px}
  .hero{padding-top:80px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">MS HOSTING</div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="tag">⚡ NEXT GENERATION CLOUD PLATFORM</div>

  <h1>HOST YOUR<br><span>DIGITAL WORLD</span></h1>

  <p>
    Welcome to MS HOSTING.
    Your platform for website hosting,
    Telegram bot management and cloud projects.
  </p>

  <a href="#services" class="btn">Explore Services</a>
  <a href="#about" class="btn secondary">Learn More</a>
</section>

<section id="services">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Our Hosting Services</h2>
    <p>Everything you need in one platform.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🌐</div>
      <h3>Website Hosting</h3>
      <p>Host HTML, CSS, JavaScript websites and publish your projects online.</p>
      <span class="status">Coming Soon</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🤖</div>
      <h3>Telegram Bot Hosting</h3>
      <p>Manage Python Telegram bots with start, stop, restart and console logs.</p>
      <span class="status">Coming Soon</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">📁</div>
      <h3>File Manager</h3>
      <p>Manage your project files and organize your hosting resources.</p>
      <span class="status">Coming Soon</span>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🛡️</div>
      <h3>Admin Panel</h3>
      <p>Manage users, projects, hosting resources and platform settings.</p>
      <span class="status">Coming Soon</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>About MS HOSTING</h2>
  </div>
  <p>
    MS HOSTING is a cloud hosting platform project
    designed to make website publishing and Telegram
    bot management easier from mobile devices.
  </p>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
  © 2026 MS HOSTING. All Rights Reserved.
  <br><br>
  Powered by MS Technology
</footer>

</body>
</html>
